stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> RECEIVED: POST /transactions
  RECEIVED --> VALIDATED: all rules pass
  RECEIVED --> PENDING_REVIEW: amount >= review threshold
  RECEIVED --> REJECTED: a business rule fails
  RECEIVED --> CANCELLED
  PENDING_REVIEW --> VALIDATED: approve (different operator)
  PENDING_REVIEW --> REJECTED: reject
  PENDING_REVIEW --> CANCELLED
  VALIDATED --> PROCESSING: worker claims it
  VALIDATED --> CANCELLED: only before processing
  PROCESSING --> COMPLETED: ledger applied (and clearing authorized)
  PROCESSING --> FAILED: refused / declined / not sent (funds returned)
  PROCESSING --> RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED: external outcome unknown (funds stay reserved)
  RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED --> COMPLETED: network confirms it executed
  RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED --> FAILED: confirmed not executed (funds returned)
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
